# Large regenerable route-trace CSVs (deterministic given fixed seeds +
# frozen HF model revisions + WikiText-2 raw v1; regenerate via the
# corresponding run_*.py driver rather than versioning multi-hundred-MB
# CSVs in git). Small result artifacts (report.md, verdict.json,
# decision.json, endpoint_summary.csv, *.png) are intentionally KEPT.
outputs/**/routes.csv
outputs/**/test_routes.csv
outputs/**/calibration_routes.csv
outputs/**/*_raw.csv
outputs/**/pair_interventions.csv
outputs/**/olmoe_test_routes.csv
outputs/**/llmjp_test_routes.csv

